{"server":"en","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-12_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-12","title":"Frost Upon the Tundra","storyCode":"6-14","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-12_end.txt","sourceHash":"8393bfd0ab98a1b325e690a0491fb24afe6671cebca8db6e60a066dd17f2bee5","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"The... the Yetis..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"...I feel so bad for them to all die in Lungmen like that. One less hope, one less legend for the Infected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Move it. The L. G. D. are on the way."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nine","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"...There's something not quite right about your eyes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"To be honest, I always thought you were a spy for Lungmen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nine","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How about now?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"No one would believe it anyway."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nine","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"A real spy would kill you to keep you quiet."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not worried about you killing me. Look at the state of Lungmen. Even if you were a Lungmenite, you can't go back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"You'd have an even worse time than we did."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nine","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...So I'm not. I'm not really anything anymore."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you doing? Wow, is that a flower?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Oooh, is this your Arts? It's pretty."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nine","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Someone has to leave them a token of respect."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Such dilly-dallying... such a waste of time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"I think it was well done. I can give top marks for wiping out the entire Reunion Movement in the city of Lungmen in a single day."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"Wei Yenwu is impressive."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"Taihe, have you heard that rumor?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You speak of Wei Yenwu's history?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Taihe","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"Delve not into such things."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"Forgive me. But how do the skills of the Black Cloaks compare to those of the Imperial Guard?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmph. You overestimate them. But they do indeed have some exceptional skill..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Taihe","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"Look out!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"You bastards!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——Infected?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"Hiss!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"——Wire?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"You don't really want to kill me, do you? You can use Arts."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"I've always heard that men who use wires as weapons are all, literally all, psychopaths."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"Indeed, they do say that..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Infected, do not interfere with official business. Take care that I lump you in with the others."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Not much to be done about unidentified armed units getting killed on the battlefield, is there?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"We can likewise testify that you are acting in coordination with Reunion."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"You don't have the authority to investigate my partner."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"We are well aware that a vessel belonging to an 'Infected Countermeasures Specialist' is docked in a Lungmen berth, Superintendent Ch'en. This is the only reason Miss Blaze has not yet come to harm."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Then how much more do you need to see? How much more must you test the people of this city with their very lives?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Speak with respect. We are assessing Lungmen's risk control capabilities due to the importance with which we regard you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Then forgive me. I'll rephrase."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you enjoying this farce?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Pfft."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Stand down, Blaze. We do not serve these fine, upstanding individuals, and they're not with the raincoats either."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"Apologies, Miss Blaze. I hope I did not cause you any displeasure."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"...You're very polite. But your tone pisses me off."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"You have an ear for Yan speech."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"You inherited much from your father. Alas, now you are but an Infected. Your path is rough. And short."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......You......?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Taihe","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"Come."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"Goodbye then, Miss Blaze, Superintendent Ch'en."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait! What did you just say about my dad?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Stop!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Blaze!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Remember the mission!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Right."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Officer Ch'en."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We found no trace of the enemy commander."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Which?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We only know of Mephisto."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Let Rhodes Island handle the rest."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"No need to rush into it. This campaign is all but over."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But he has to pay... for the atrocities he committed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Then we'll leave it to you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's part ways for now. I have one more thing I need to see with my own eyes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait a minute, L. G. D. lady."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"What is it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"...Thanks for that, back there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"That's all."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure. You too."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Why did you have to pick that moment to act? Blaze... You're not the type to make mistakes at a time like this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"For one thing, I was really mad..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"For another, I could tell that L. G. D. lady, Ch'en, was getting mad too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We also can't tell which of the two sides has the right to speak."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"So I pick the one I like."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry. It won't happen again."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...No, Blaze. It's my turn to say it won't happen again."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But I can't say that. I can't promise that."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"The Yetis..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Silly rabbit."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey, don't pat my head. I need to get taller..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...At least, don't pat it too long."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"I know, I know."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"How do you feel?"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"You.","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Can I help you?","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"I was in the neighborhood."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Your emotional state is fluctuating. It seems you had a deeper interaction with this Reunion unit in the Chernobog ruins."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"As far as I can tell, the captain of this unit did not participate in the battle."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"That means...","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Lungmen won't keep chasing these Infected. But Rhodes Island has to do more."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Lungmen won't interfere with what happens next. And you can choose not to participate."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"...But you will participate. Whether the Infected is codenamed 'Mephisto' or 'FrostNova.'"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Where are you going?","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"I have my work cut out for me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, and Dr. {@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't look at me like that."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Stop with the cloak and dagger.","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Amiya said Rhodes Island needs trust.","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"But you and I don't need trust."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"You need the trust of Rhodes Island's operators, not me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——I know you too well to trust you. Just like you never trusted me, in the old days."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"How would I know the old days?","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"The old days?","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Is there anything I can do about it now?","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Right."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"I misspoke. Forget it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Be careful in the next operation. Only the most dangerous of commanders would train such a squad of Infected who would fight to the death without flinching."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course, it's up to you if you want to see it through to the end."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"And do conserve your energy. We may not have time to rest."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"The battle for Lungmen is over.","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"It's not that simple. At least, that's what I think."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. {@nickname}, from now on, it's up to you to decide if you will shoulder the burden of responsibility for Rhodes Island..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"...'Whether or not to be one worthy of the trust of a Rhodes Island operator.'"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah, FrostNova, ma'am, you're awake..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"...Take it easy! Let me help you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm fine. I'm not... so fragile."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"Where are you going? You can't go back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Then, my brothers and sisters..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"...You can't go back!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"It was for your sake that they..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't insult my squad!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"They did... *cough* look out for me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"But it was for the Infected that they gave their lives so bravely!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"They fought their last battle so that more of their people could live, not for the sake of any one person!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"*Cough* *cough hack* *cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"*Cough* Guh... Mmg..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"FrostNova, ma'am..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Enough with the ma'am. Are you calling me that because I look weak to you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"It's just, they put you in our care like this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"And now they're gone, and I never got to keep my promises to them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't even have a chance to make amends."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"FrostNova..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"...The one slumped at the wall there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Mephisto."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"He's still unconscious?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"We don't know. He's been like that the whole time. He says nothing. Does nothing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Take him back. It's enough."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood. Phew, I thought you'd..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I'd what?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"I thought you'd kill him."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"There's no need for that anymore. I think I know what happened outside the slums."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"That disheartened look in his eyes..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"...And, from time to time..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I recall that day, three or four years ago, when he tried his very hardest to sing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"He can sing? But Faust said, his throat..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"He really tried."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Just like all of us Infected. Though we will all someday succumb to Oripathy..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"We still try our very hardest to live."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Let the rest of his life continue to punish him."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Tell me, Phantom Crossbowman, was Rhodes Island involved in that fight?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you mean...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"...No, as far as I know, they didn't fight the Yetis."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"...So childish."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you sure you want to stay?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"They may not come after us, FrostNova. You don't have to die here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I met a few people in the ruins. I want to see them again."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I promised them, actually."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"And I know they're coming."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Phantom Crossbowman","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"FrostNova..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Go on, brother."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion lost this battle. And just maybe, Reunion did wrong."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"But you haven't. You still have a choice, you can do better."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Go on. And don't look back."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["Kal'tsit"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["Ch'en"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["Blaze"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["FrostNova","Phantom Crossbowman"]}]}
